      "before": "**Namespaces.** Every project lease names a namespace from the host namespace",
      "after": "**Native registry projection.** The selected registry owner distinguishes the complete RegistryDocument from RegisteredNamespaceList (ACTIVE and RETIRED N strings) and RegistryStartGate (zero RESERVED, prior active slot retired). RESERVED/ABANDONED rows grant no project lease. Retired registered N keeps its stable lease carriers; required unavailable carriers cannot be skipped or recreated. Ordinary contexts retain their admitted row and project handles/lease after releasing the fence, tolerating unrelated registry replacement.\n\n**Namespaces.** Every project lease names a namespace from the host namespace"
